      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="margin-top:18px">{e(Y301["name"])} ({Y301["code"]}) stands on {d[0]:.2f} × {d[1]:.2f}&nbsp;m, about {Y_FOOT:.1f}&nbsp;m². Its published safety zone is {z[1]:.2f} × {z[2]:.2f}&nbsp;m, about {Y_ZONE:.0f}&nbsp;m². Plan the zone first and the layout follows.</p>
